From c55f52e146ca9707f360ffe53d1b1fdcd63dc765 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:51:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Closed loop only between a minimum and a maximum RPM
 (pro-style)

New stft.minRpm / stft.maxRpm (0 = no limit). Outside the window the short term trim
is off (state stftDisabledRpmWindow), so the engine runs on the base map.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
